,"t":1736432752,"iso":"2025-01-09T14:25:52.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":1,"author":"aquicklolz","author_id":"624016875","text":"@EvanLuthra Spread more misinformation please…. 🤦🏽‍♂️","in_corpus":false,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.405,"parent_id":"1877355031717957878","conversation_id":"1877355031717957878"},{"id":"1877357962395635977","x":0.007987,"y":2.0,"t":1736431992,"iso":"2025-01-09T14:13:12.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":1,"author":"ShibiPayamal","author_id":"3134574714","text":"@EvanLuthra There is no cause for alarm, it's a regular winter virus https://t.co/8qIIiyYFVm","in_corpus":false,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.194,"parent_id":"1877355031717957878","conversation_id":"1877355031717957878"},{"id":"1877355172973703179","x":0.000388,"y":1.0,"t":1736431327,"iso":"2025-01-09T14:02:07.000Z","rt":2,"replies":1,"quotes":1,"likes":10,"relation":"quote","niveau":1,"author":"EvanLuthra","author_id":"206930103","text":"That’s a wrap.\n\nIf you found this valuable, make sure to:\n\n• Like the first tweet.\n• Repost and Bookmark.\n• Follow me @EvanLuthra for more like this.\n\nhttps://t.co/3ElXf4FPlu","in_corpus":false,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":2,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.009,"parent_id":"1877355031717957878","conversation_id":"1877355031717957878"},{"id":"1877355036856250860","x":2.3e-05,"y":0.0,"t":1736431295,"iso":"2025-01-09T14:01:35Z","rt":2,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":8,"relation":"reply","niveau":1,"author":"EvanLuthra","author_id":"206930103","text":"What is HMPV?\n\nHMPV (human metapneumovirus) is a respiratory virus that causes symptoms like coughing, fever, and congestion.\n\nIt was discovered in 2001, but it’s been circulating for centuries.\n\n⟜ Mild cases: Common cold-like symptoms.\n⟜ Severe cases: Pneumonia or bronchitis https://t.co/M11jwUwKmF","in_corpus":true,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":10,"subtree_size":5,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1877355031717957878","conversation_id":"1877355031717957878"},{"id":"1877355041297936618","x":3.4e-05,"y":0.0,"t":1736431296,"iso":"2025-01-09T14:01:36.000Z","rt":2,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":5,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"EvanLuthra","author_id":"206930103","text":"Why now?\n\nIt’s winter in the Northern Hemisphere, prime time for respiratory viruses to spread.\n\nCold air, poor ventilation, and packed indoor spaces make infections almost inevitable. https://t.co/0Z1ub5HT5S","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":8,"subtree_size":4,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1877355036856250860","conversation_id":"1877355031717957878"},{"id":"1877355044393070755","x":3.4e-05,"y":0.0,"t":1736431296,"iso":"2025-01-09T14:01:36Z","rt":2,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":4,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"EvanLuthra","author_id":"206930103","text":"HMPV isn’t new, but its current intensity is catching attention.\n\nNorthern China’s hospitals are overwhelmed, with cases climbing in neighbouring regions like India.\n\nThe question is; how much disruption it will cause....if it spreads?","in_corpus":true,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":6,"subtree_size":3,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1877355041297936618","conversation_id":"1877355031717957878"},{"id":"1877355046977024356","x":4.6e-05,"y":0.0,"t":1736431297,"iso":"2025-01-09T14:01:37Z","rt":2,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":4,"relation":"reply","niveau":4,"author":"EvanLuthra","author_id":"206930103","text":"HMPV is not another C-19.\n\nUnlike the coronavirus, HMPV has been circulating quietly for years.\n\nIt mutates far less frequently, meaning it’s less prone to sudden, dangerous variants.\n\nBut there’s no vaccine or treatment for HMPV yet.\n\nAnd when people get sick in large numbers,","in_corpus":true,"depth":4,"subtree_rt":4,"subtree_size":2,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1877355044393070755","conversation_id":"1877355031717957878"},{"id":"1877355049124508115","x":4.6e-05,"y":0.0,"t":1736431297,"iso":"2025-01-09T14:01:37.000Z","rt":2,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":3,"relation":"reply","niveau":5,"author":"EvanLuthra","author_id":"206930103","text":"Why does this matter globally?\n\nChina is the world’s factory.\n\nAny slowdown there ( whether it’s labour shortages or factory closures) can create ripple effects.","in_corpus":false,"depth":5,"subtree_rt":2,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1877355046977024356","conversation_id":"1877355031717957878"}],"edges":[{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877355036856250860","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877355172973703179","relation":"quote"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877357962395635977","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877361148015603936","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877364083734818919","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877364375788388527","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877365956042805613","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877367673765433478","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877367923339117005","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877368194295300158","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877369678684663837","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877371306460827806","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877374117147517220","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877378976424812785","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877382848811815245","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877382868311113887","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877383056312430959","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877355031717957878","target":"1877383166324818262","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1877